{"articleNo":"2468","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2468&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 1학기 등록금 납부확인서 발급 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.03.02","hit":"12598","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font><u><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"4\">등록금 납부확인서 발급 안내</font><br></font></u></strong><br><br><br><font size=\"3\">* <u>발급대상</u> : 2010학년도 1학기 등록금 납부자<br><br>* <u>발급방법</u> : 원스톱서비스-등록-등록금 납부내역 조회-납부확인서 클릭<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (신입생, 편입생의 경우 신규등록 후 사용 가능)<br><br>* <u>발급기간</u> : 등록금납부 다음날~5월 31일까지<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (신입생, 편입생의 경우 3월 1일~5월 31일까지)<br><br><br><br><br>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2010.&nbsp; 03.&nbsp; 02.&nbsp;<br><br><br><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font size=\"4\">총&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 과&nbsp; 장</font></strong></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
